 need to locate your account first.  Right now, I only have your phone number and the wire details. To find the"},{"s":175.8,"e":176.2,"who":"user","text":"Okay. What do you need from me?"},{"s":179.6,"e":195.8,"who":"agent","text":"Got it\u2014let\u2019s figure out your customer record first so we can route the wire details correctly. Thanks for clarifying. I\u2019ve already got the routing and account info you\u2019re trying to use, and the amount.  To locate your account, I\u2019ll need your full name on the account first. Once you give"},{"s":195.8,"e":196.6,"who":"user","text":"Priya Deshmukh."},{"s":199.2,"e":203.8,"who":"agent","text":"Got it, thanks for that. To locate your profile, I\u2019ll need your full name too, since the lo"},{"s":203.8,"e":204.6,"who":"user","text":"I already gave it\u2014Priya Deshmukh."},{"s":208.6,"e":209.4,"who":"agent","text":"Thanks for clarifying. Let me take a moment to confirm what I heard before we proceed. Thanks, I have your name and the phone number. To move forward with the wire, I need to find which account you want to send it from. You don\u2019t know the account ID yet, no worries. I can look up your accounts once we confirm the right customer record. First, I\u2019ll need a quick confirmation: the phone number you provided is"},{"s":235.8,"e":236.4,"who":"user","text":"Yes."},{"s":241.4,"e":255.8,"who":"agent","text":"Thanks, I\u2019ve located your checking account based on what we have, but for a same-day wire, we need to verify your identity before we send it.  Please provide, one at a time, your date of birth, your street address, and the"},{"s":255.8,"e":256.4,"who":"user","text":"August 14th, 1991. Hang on\u2014my dog just got into something in the yard, one second."},{"s":265.6,"e":276.8,"who":"agent","text":"Oh, take your time! Dogs do have a way of deciding they\u2019re in charge for a few moments.   You said your date of birth is August 14, 1991\u2014did I hear that correctly? Once you\u2019re ready, we\u201